WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.710
In 1529, two great
reformers met at Marburg.

2
00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:10.360
Martin Luther and Huldrych Zwingli
agreed on 14 out of 15 articles.

3
00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:16.130
They split over one: four words that Luke's
Gospel gives Jesus at the Last Supper.

4
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:18.180
This is my body.

5
00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:22.630
So when Christians share bread and wine,
what do they believe they are really

6
00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:23.940
receiving?

7
00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:26.930
In this mission, you'll
meet an old pair of ideas,

8
00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:30.990
substance and accidents, and
see how Catholics use them.

9
00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:35.610
Then you'll map the views, from Catholic
and Orthodox churches to Luther,

10
00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:37.720
Zwingli and the Baptists.

11
00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:42.160
Your mission: find out what different
Christians believe happens to the bread

12
00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:42.920
and wine.
